167, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 845575, "platform": 49, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}, {"id": 845576, "platform": 169, "release_region": {"id": 8, "region": "worldwide"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 402428, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mik.jpg"}, {"id": 402429, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mil.jpg"}, {"id": 402418, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mia.jpg"}, {"id": 402419, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mib.jpg"}, {"id": 402420, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mic.jpg"}, {"id": 402421, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mid.jpg"}, {"id": 402422, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mie.jpg"}, {"id": 402423, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mif.jpg"}, {"id": 402424, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mig.jpg"}, {"id": 402425, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mih.jpg"}, {"id": 402426, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mii.jpg"}, {"id": 402427, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8mij.jpg"}], "slug": "dark-fracture", "storyline": "Dark Fracture takes place in the late '90s, set in an isolated forested region in the rural USA. You are put in the shoes of Edward: a body farm employee who is pained by his past, and only finding solace in the medicine that helps him get through the day. Edward is barely able to cope with his personal issues, which are only intensified by him living in solitude. He puts on a brave front and dutifully wakes up for work every day. His routine serves as his only anchor, but deep inside, trouble is simmering...\n\nOne night, while working the dreaded midnight shift, a chain of disturbing events draws Edward ever close to losing his grip on reality. As the very fabric of his world seems to unravel and twist. His home of the past few years is being pulled from under his feet. The cruel hand of fate once more nudging him towards disaster. One that threatens to engulf Edward's home in shadow.\n\nIs it merely his mind playing tricks on him? Or perhaps there truly is something darker clawing at his heels, threatening to drag him into the depths? We're counting on you to figure it out: The choices you make will shape the results of his terrifying tale. Trapped between a world of horrors inspired by the works of ones such as H.R. Giger, and the unkind reality of the body farm from whence he came. Survive a twofold nightmare in Dark Fracture!", "summary": "Dark Fracture is a psychological horror experience in which you explore an ever-changing world where reality and nightmares collide. Walk on the edge of madness in the shoes of a tormented soul as you descend into the darkest depths of the human psyche, and question everything you see.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dark-fracture", "videos": [{"id": 40371, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "XZtwAC2WWoI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XZtwAC2WWoI", "title": "Dark Fracture - Gameplay Walkthrough | gamescom 2020", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XZtwAC2WWoI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 38516, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "nFZvw2vB17w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nFZvw2vB17w", "title": "Dark Fracture: Prologue Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nFZvw2vB17w/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 38517, "name": "Cinematic Trailer", "video_id": "7yyqV6EHyYg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7yyqV6EHyYg", "title": "Dark Fracture: Prologue Environment Teaser", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7yyqV6EHyYg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 97383, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gWjkZ2ByW7M", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gWjkZ2ByW7M", "title": "Dark Fracture - Exclusive Trailer | Black Summer 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gWjkZ2ByW7M/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 164070, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-a65IqqhzHQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-a65IqqhzHQ", "title": "Dark Fracture | Horror Game Awards HALLOWEEN SHOWCASE TRAILER 2025", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-a65IqqhzHQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 185790, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "oL_9u5S2YY0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oL_9u5S2YY0", "title": "DARK FRACTURE | Midsummer Night's Scream: A HORROR GAME AWARDS SHOWCASE 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oL_9u5S2YY0/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 6363, "name": "Dark Fracture"}]}